      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Fifty-one patients with human immunodeficiency virus infection and acute coronary syndromes were identified. Nearly all patients (98%) had traditional coronary risk factors. Revascularization procedures were performed safely with low in-hospital mortality."},
